-07-30","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/talrand-sky-summoner-2012-07-30","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/talrand-sky-summoner-2012-07-30#:~:text=I%20didn%27t%20want%20to%20have%20to%20kill%20you.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Talrand, Sky Summoner\" by Ken Troop. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 30 Jul 2012."}},{"id":"talrand-sky-summoner-2012-07-30-e4","era":null,"summary":"Kalyntri attacks with flame while Talrand uses fog, geysers and water walls to evade him.","participants":["kalyntri","talrand"],"location":"kapsho-seas","importance":"major","page":"stories/talrand-sky-summoner-2012-07-30","order":347,"story_date":"2012-07-30","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":14,"quote":"Kalyntri roared, an incandescent rush of rage that transmuted into scalding flame","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/talrand-sky-summoner-2012-07-30#:~:text=Kalyntri%20roared%2C%20an%20incandescent,transmuted%20into%20scalding%20flame","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Talrand, Sky Summoner","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Ken Troop"],"date":"2012-07-30","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/talrand-sky-summoner-2012-07-30","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/talrand-sky-summoner-2012-07-30#:~:text=Kalyntri%20roared%2C%20an%20incandescent,transmuted%20into%20scalding%20flame","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Talrand, Sky Summoner\" by Ken Troop. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 30 Jul 2012."}},{"id":"talrand-sky-summoner-2012-07-30-e5","era":null,"summary":"Kalyntri bludgeons Talrand with his tail and body, sending him skipping onto an island beach.","participants":["kalyntri","talrand"],"location":"kapsho-seas","importance":"minor","page":"stories/talrand-sky-summoner-2012-07-30","order":347,"story_date":"2012-07-30","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":16,"quote":"The impact of the blow sent Tal