xt=Service%20to%20me%20means,dragons.%20He%20is%20yours.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Talrand, Sky Summoner\" by Ken Troop. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 30 Jul 2012."}},{"id":"bard-and-biologist-2014-07-09-e3","era":null,"summary":"Yisan and Jalira journey through the Kalonian Forest, fending off corrupted beasts and avoiding Talrand's aerial patrols.","participants":["yisan","jalira","talrand"],"location":"kalonian-wilds","importance":"minor","page":"stories/bard-and-biologist-2014-07-09","order":427,"story_date":"2014-07-09","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":57,"quote":"Neither counted the drake summoner as a friend for a variety of differing reasons","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/bard-and-biologist-2014-07-09#:~:text=Neither%20counted%20the%20drake,variety%20of%20differing%20reasons","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Bard and the Biologist","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Matt Knicl"],"date":"2014-07-09","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/bard-and-biologist-2014-07-09","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/bard-and-biologist-2014-07-09#:~:text=Neither%20counted%20the%20drake,variety%20of%20differing%20reasons","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Bard and the Biologist\" by Matt Knicl. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 9 Jul 2014."}},{"id":"shandalar-e14","era":{"date":"2023-04-21","era":"mom","label":"March of the Machine"},"summary":"Drakes and merfolk under the Kapsho Sea die driving the Phyrexians to the edges of the world.","participants":["talrand","kapsho-seas"],"location":"kapsho-seas","importance":"minor","page":"wiki/shandalar","order":1709,"story_date":"","storyline":"","source":"mtg-wiki","paragraph":20,"quote":"They drove the Phyrexians to the edges of the world, and they died there.","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Shandalar#:~:text=They%20drove%20the%20Phyrexians,and%20they%20died%20there.","